() Tj T*
(ID 3  - notification-svc   Owner: Aisha Khan       Tier: 2) Tj T*
(        On-call rota: platform-secondary. SLO: 99.5% availability.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(ID 4  - reporting-batch    Owner: Tom Iverson      Tier: 3) Tj T*
(        On-call rota: none \(business hours only\). No availability SLO.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Tier 1 services require a two-person review for any production change.) Tj T*
(Tier 3 services may be deployed by a single engineer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. Maintenance Windows) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Planned maintenance runs Sundays 02:00-04:00 UTC. Tier 1 services require) Tj T*
(14 days notice to customers; Tier 2 and 3 require 3 days notice.) Tj T*
ET
